## 5. 数据准备

### 5.1 COCO（train_coco.sh 之前）

```bash
# ① NLTK 实体
python -c "
from load_annotations import load_captions
from entities_extraction import main
main(load_captions('coco_captions', './annotations/coco/train_captions.json'),
     './annotations/coco/coco_with_entities.pickle')"

# ② 文本 CLIP 特征
python -c "
from texts_features_extraction import main
main('cuda:0','ViT-B/32',
     './annotations/coco/coco_with_entities.pickle',
     './annotations/coco/coco_texts_features_ViT-B32.pickle')"

# ③ ILR 邻居
bash scripts/build_ilr_neighbors_coco.sh 0

# ④ 图像特征（C³ 需要）
python images_features_extraction.py

# ⑤ C³ 模态均值
python compute_embed_means.py \
  --path_of_text_features ./annotations/coco/coco_texts_features_ViT-B32.pickle \
  --path_of_image_features ./annotations/coco/test_captions_ViT-B32.pickle
```

### 5.2 Flickr30k（train_flickr30k.sh 之前）

将上述路径中的 `coco` 换为 `flickr30k`，实体/load_captions 使用 `flickr30k_captions`；
ILR 使用 `bash scripts/build_ilr_neighbors_flickr30k.sh 0`；
均值输出到 `annotations/flickr30k/normalized_*_embed_mean.pt`。

**NLTK 依赖**（首次运行需下载）：

```bash
python -c "import nltk; nltk.download('punkt'); nltk.download('punkt_tab');
nltk.download('averaged_perceptron_tagger'); nltk.download('wordnet'); nltk.download('omw-1.4')"
```

