## 6. 训练与推理命令

### 6.1 COCO 训练 + 评测（C³ + Gated + ILR）

```bash
# 训练
REMOVE_MEAN=1 FUSION_TYPE=gated bash scripts/train_coco.sh 0

# COCO 评测
REMOVE_MEAN=1 USE_ILR=1 FUSION_TYPE=gated \
  bash scripts/eval_coco_meacap.sh train_coco 0 14

# NoCaps 评测
REMOVE_MEAN=1 USE_ILR=1 FUSION_TYPE=gated \
  bash scripts/eval_nocaps_meacap.sh train_coco 0 14
```

### 6.2 Flickr30k 训练 + 评测

```bash
REMOVE_MEAN=1 FUSION_TYPE=gated bash scripts/train_flickr30k.sh 0

REMOVE_MEAN=1 USE_ILR=1 FUSION_TYPE=gated \
  bash scripts/eval_flickr30k_meacap.sh train_flickr30k 0 29
```

### 6.3 跨数据集评测（重要）

**均值文件跟 checkpoint 走，不跟评测数据集走：**

```bash
# COCO 权重 → 评 Flickr，必须用 COCO 均值
REMOVE_MEAN=1 USE_ILR=1 FUSION_TYPE=gated \
  TEXT_EMBED_MEAN_PATH=./annotations/coco/normalized_text_embed_mean.pt \
  IMAGE_EMBED_MEAN_PATH=./annotations/coco/normalized_image_embed_mean.pt \
  MEMORY_ID=coco \
  bash scripts/eval_flickr30k_meacap.sh train_coco 0 14

# Flickr 权重 → 评 COCO，必须用 Flickr 均值
REMOVE_MEAN=1 USE_ILR=1 FUSION_TYPE=gated \
  TEXT_EMBED_MEAN_PATH=./annotations/flickr30k/normalized_text_embed_mean.pt \
  IMAGE_EMBED_MEAN_PATH=./annotations/flickr30k/normalized_image_embed_mean.pt \
  MEMORY_ID=flickr30k \
  bash scripts/eval_coco_meacap.sh train_flickr30k 0 29
```

