## 9. 消融实验建议

| 实验 | 命令差异 |
|------|----------|
| Baseline（无 C³） | 不加 `REMOVE_MEAN=1` |
| 仅 C³ Collapse | `REMOVE_MEAN=1`，可设 `--noise_variance 0` |
| C³ + Linear ILR | `FUSION_TYPE=linear REMOVE_MEAN=1` |
| C³ + Gated ILR（本分支主配置） | `FUSION_TYPE=gated REMOVE_MEAN=1` |
| C³ + Internal_gated | `FUSION_TYPE=internal_gated REMOVE_MEAN=1` |

